# Required, no fallback. Cloudflare's always-pass test sitekey is NOT usable: the Worker pins both hostname
# and action, and siteverify's canned dummy response carries neither. Use the dev Turnstile widget
# (`terraform output -raw dev_turnstile_sitekey` in sobok-ops).
NEXT_PUBLIC_TURNSTILE_SITE_KEY=<dev-turnstile-sitekey>
